{
  "about": "`all` before a plural takes what its singular names, `-s`, `-es` or `-ies` read off, or what a kind's name names; a set role takes them at once; once nothing qualifies, or a plural names nothing in reach, it is `not_here`; `all` before a run is `unknown`.",
  "steps": [
    { "arrive": "Marta", "expect": [
      { "reader": "Marta", "kind": "described", "words": "There is nothing special about the tea room." }
    ] },
